#, no-wrap
msgid "Mobile app (Android)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Capacitor shell + unified shell-ui SPA (Chat / Admin / settings).  \n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "> Package: [`app/mobile/`](../../app/mobile/)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item       | Description                                                              |\n"
"| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Platform   | **Android only** sideload (APK); iOS later                               |\n"
"| Modules    | Chat (`sap-direct`) + Admin (`hub-rest`)                                 |\n"
"| Hub config | APP **Hub settings**: URL + Service API Token (`fa_at_...`, Preferences) |\n"
"| Hub duties | `/api` REST + `/sap/v1` WebSocket                                        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:19 docs/sap/overview.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Topology"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart LR\n"
"  Phone[Android WebView]\n"
"  Shell[shell-ui SPA]\n"
"  Chat[\"/chat\"]\n"
"  Admin[\"/admin\"]\n"
"  Settings[\"/settings\"]\n"
"  Hub[Anima Service]\n"
"\n"
"  Phone --> Shell\n"
"  Shell --> Chat\n"
"  Shell --> Admin\n"
"  Shell --> Settings\n"
"  Chat -->|SAP auth_token| Hub\n"
"  Admin -->|REST Bearer| Hub\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:39
msgid ""
"Mobile REST **connects directly** to Hub (no desktop Electron `/api` proxy); "
"requires a **Service API Token** and Hub CORS for Capacitor origin (`https://"
"localhost`). Routes use hash (`#/chat`) for WebView debugging."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hub settings"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid ""
"Home PC: `anima service start --host 0.0.0.0`, create a Service API Token "
"(`anima token create --subject-id 1 --name bootstrap`; see [`remote-"
"access.md`](../guide/remote-access.md))."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "(Optional) `anima tunnel setup`; phone uses `https://<your-hostname>`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "APP → **Hub settings** (`/settings`):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "Hub URL (Tunnel domain or `http://<PC-IP>:2658`; not `127.0.0.1`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '   - '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid "Service API Token (`fa_at_...`, printed once at creation)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:48
msgid ""
"**Test connection** → **Save and enter** → top bar switches **Chat** / "
"**Admin**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:50
msgid ""
"Non-loopback Hub URL requires token; REST uses `Authorization: Bearer`; SAP "
"sends `auth_token` in `connect` frame."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                             | Common cause                                                                                    |\n"
"| ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Keyboard covers chat input          | WebView not resizing; need `adjustResize` + `@capacitor/keyboard`; `cap sync` after Web changes |\n"
"| Chat input unresponsive             | No selected conversation (first install should auto-create); or SAP disconnected                |\n"
"| Admin load failed / Failed to fetch | Hub not `--host 0.0.0.0`, wrong token, firewall; Chrome Remote Debugging for Bearer header      |\n"
"| Not Found                           | Avoid legacy paths like `/admin/dashboard/index.html`; use SPA `/admin/dashboard`               |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:63
msgid "Settings → **Debug** (desktop and mobile share shell-ui panel):"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:69
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Capability | Desktop           | Mobile                                      |\n"
"| ---------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Sentry     | DSN in settings   | Same                                        |\n"
"| DevTools   | F12 / dev package | Debug APK + USB → Chrome `chrome://inspect` |\n"
"| Console    | Electron DevTools | vConsole (settings toggle)                  |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:71
msgid ""
"Mobile debug build: `cd app/mobile && bun run android:debug` (no minify + "
"sourcemap for inspect)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build and sideload"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"bun run --filter @freeanima/app-mobile build\n"
"cd app/mobile && bun run sync\n"
"cd android && ./gradlew assembleDebug\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:81
msgid "Debug full flow: `cd app/mobile && bun run android:debug`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Discipline**: after shell-ui / chat / admin frontend changes, run `bun run build` (or `build:debug`) then `cap sync`, or device serves stale Web assets.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:85
msgid "Package README: [`app/mobile/README.md`](../../app/mobile/README.md)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs desktop shell"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|              | Electron `app/desktop`                          | Capacitor `app/mobile`                |\n"
"| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Injection    | preload → `window.satelliteShell`               | `shell-bridge.js` → same-shaped API   |\n"
"| Hub config   | Hub settings → `~/.anima-desktop/settings.json` | Hub settings → Preferences            |\n"
"| Debug/Sentry | Settings → Debug → same file `debug`            | Settings → Debug → Preferences        |\n"
"| REST         | Local static `/api` proxy (same origin)         | Direct `hubUrl/api/*` (CORS + Bearer) |\n"
"| instance_id  | File `~/.anima/satellites/chat/`                | Preferences                           |\n"
"| Content      | chat + admin + companion                        | chat + admin                          |\n"
msgstr ""
